**Summarizing labeling spec and process integration**

I'll compile a summary highlighting the new external labeling spec support along with the added labeling_apply process and optional export-time labeling integration. I'll cover the main code and config changes, mention the test we added, note the pytest missing error on test run, and suggest next steps including installing pytest and running the new process. I'll also list all changed files neatly at the end as requested.
