Using S20_HYDRA_CONFIG, S40_PROCESS_IMPLEMENTATION, S70_VISUALIZATION_DS, S98_GOVERNANCE to keep Hydra groups, process artifacts/reporting, and tests aligned.

Added external labeling spec support with a new labeling_apply process and optional export-time labeling so derived label layers and reports are produced from an external YAML spec.
- Implemented LabelingSpec load/hash/apply plus labels_* JSON-string serialization in `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/labeling.py`.
- Added `wafer_particles.process.labeling_apply` with export input wiring, spec snapshot/hash meta, layer/group reports, and metrics/plots placeholders in `src/synthlab/processes/labeling_apply.py`, and registered it in `src/synthlab/processes/__init__.py`.
